@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

title actraild 当前核心运行时组件

cloud "Linux kernel / TLS sync" as Sources
component "Control & Attach\n控制命令、trace 绑定、采集挂载" as Control
component "Collectors & Ingest\n事件、payload、身份与 membership" as Ingest
component "Protocol & LLM\nHTTP、SSE、provider 投影" as Protocol
component "Semantic Runtime\naction、link、MCP、tool" as Semantic
component "Governance\n文件、命令与网络控制" as Governance
component "Plugin Host\nobservation / control / codec / alert" as Plugins
component "Recording & Export\n事务写入与 best-effort 导出" as Output
database "Storage" as Storage

Sources -down-> Ingest : kernel events / plaintext
Control -right-> Ingest : trace 与采集配置
Ingest -down-> Protocol : plaintext / HTTP evidence
Ingest -right-> Semantic : DomainEvent / PayloadSegment
Protocol -right-> Semantic : LLM actions 与诊断
Plugins -left-> Protocol : LLM codec
Plugins -up-> Governance : control decision
Semantic -down-> Plugins : observation batch
Semantic -right-> Output : actions / links / content
Governance -left-> Ingest : enforcement events
Output -down-> Storage : 单事务持久化

note bottom of Output
  导出使用方失败不回滚主存储
end note
@enduml
